{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uHhxiGtBlh1WrhaFytGTLA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:23.297210+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/uHhxiGtBlh1WrhaFytGTLA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/oqiciasFiaaPHoXIndA1vxvDBceWDBQXHH4o7xlKBdKn2hGIKuu1g5Jy2T7z6HDQfCSOTVgBp2FUzuQ6JiaWUkbaMKkY2NMb3XrRdCjTx7DiacY0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Summer Camp</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京大学化学学院与深研院化生学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营将于7月4日—7月6日举行。请已确认入营的同学按照要求准备、提交相关材料，并在规定时间内到北京大学化学与分子工程学院报到！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/oqiciasFiaaPHrAzAQpN5vgleibAApBc7p6bBqhTjjauydHMBhd1YkYLXicp5Sdu2VVI4RswuHPQFJ4eBDnztcsC2Mnxt0Rk9w7MElPOYPDhXamM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、请已填写确认参营问卷的同学准备不超过8分钟的ppt。主要内容包括个人简介，曾经参加过的科研工作，或者自己印象深刻的基础实验，或者自己印象深刻的科学上的重大发现等。具体可参考附件模板制作。PPT以本人“中文姓名-学校”命名，在夏令营报名系统中进行上传。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>如在截止时间前有修改需求，可修改后重复上传，以最后一版为准（请仔细检查后再提交，尽量避免多次修改上传）。截止时间为</span><strong><span>7月1日17:00</span></strong><span>前，之后一律不允许修改，请参营同学检查好ppt后再提交！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/oqiciasFiaaPHoTgRgeEthiblaPP5PnrCfHBe5HibHxG6h8cNn4CXwXI9YdXvtKpDET4DxxvZ3qBrpeVV5DVhZBDJ92v7ITXVjR61JoMONNEEQdA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2、报到日期：7月4日10:00—16:00；</span></p><p><span>报到地点：北京大学化学学院C区一楼大厅</span></p><p><span>报到注意事项：</span><strong><span>夏令营的化学基础知识测试安排在7月4日晚18:30，请务必安排好报到时间！</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/oqiciasFiaaPHps8lgh9Y1LVe5utdAmF4icoJFywibHnf6vj6tZgH8q1qbH3KXwHg3S3d4hGzDFT6yGlqgRAIIW2021piam0CPa3viakqjdyWnSbNE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>3. 请大家打印到北京的火车票报销凭证，夏令营给予同学由学校（或家庭所在地）到北京的硬座、硬卧、高铁动车二等座费用作为参加夏令营的路费补助。如乘坐飞机，无法报销补助。具体事宜及特殊情况请查看火车票报销说明。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oqiciasFiaaPHr3YaQTiakv0XicibbicJPVDSbUibiaqDQXNW8VxvdrkiaotNQRwc6ic0qg7IYCs9nVPpLIObqT9wdYAW1xvfAN1wJZcibI2KSYWSZDRIvU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>4、夏令营期间，将为外地参营同学提供学校内的住宿。若无特殊情况，北京市各高校参营同学将不再安排统一住宿。如不需要集体住宿，同学需向官方邮箱发送邮件说明情况，产生的费用无法报销。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>相关文件前往北大化院官网查看下载。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>如有疑问可以向公众号（PKU_CCME）后台留言咨询。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>北京大学化学与分子工程学院</span></p><p><span>北京大学化学生物学与生物技术学院</span><span><br/></span><span> 2026年6月</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oqiciasFiaaPHoibUJ3IaibNBgGkzRcwM9t21U0Z9cZjsQHO7kFPWLW03VTXaItrpxc5ib0N8PHiciaSSZu8pGJn6XQfsBKNILJrUGvsRaZwehx2e44/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6df82bda42c09947fbb6b34656702af89a712717b89296cf7add30283db0b5c2","textLength":679,"sourceSha256":"3202e655e9f706cddf27046d14ccbf3993783783787f1f1565b66f67b057fa4a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7812f1a962c2e89a7bd3","title":"2026年北京大学化学与分子工程学院与深研院化生学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营”第三轮通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:23.297210+00:00"}
